{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39242","headline":"将卜兰芷村居留别郡中在仕 · 韦庄","name":"将卜兰芷村居留别郡中在仕","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"兰芷江头寄断蓬，移家空载一颿风。\n伯伦嗜酒还因乱，平子归田不爲穷。\n避世漂零人境外，结茅依约画屏中。\n从今隐去应难觅，深入芦花作钓翁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦庄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39242.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39242","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}